tablishing Japan's first private university.\n<br><br>\nUltimately, his ambition and dream of founding a university were not realized during his lifetime. However, that dream has been continuously passed down and lives on within the students, alumni, and faculty of present-day Doshisha.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Official site, translated)"}, {"id": 213353, "idMal": 62634, "title": {"romaji": "Given: 10th Mix", "english": "Given: Moments in Life", "native": "ギヴン 10th mix (OAD)"}, "synonyms": ["given: glimpses of life"], "format": "OVA", "status": "FINISHED", "episodes": 1, "duration": 18, "source": "MANGA", "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "isAdult": false, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2025, "startDate": {"year": 2025, "month": 10, "day": 1}, "endDate": {"year": 2025, "month": 10, "day": 1}, "genres": ["Drama", "Music", "Romance", "Slice of Life"], "tags": [{"name": "Boys' Love", "rank": 60, "category": "Theme-Romance", "isMediaSpoiler": false, "isGeneralSpoiler": false}, {"name": "Time Skip", "rank": 20, "category": "Setting-Time", "isMediaSpoiler": false, "isGeneralSpoiler": true}, {"name": "Band", "rank": 20, "category": "Theme-Arts-Music", "isMediaSpoiler": false, "isGeneralSpoiler": false}], "studios": {"edges": [{"isMain": true, "node": {"id": 456, "name": "Lerche", "isAnimationStudio": true}}, {"isMain": false, "node": {"id": 169, "name": "Fuji TV", "isAnimationStudio": false}}, {"isMain": false, "node": {"id": 6855, "name": "Shinshokan", "isAnimationStudio": false}}, {"isMain": false, "node": {"id": 17, "name": "Aniplex", "isAnimationStudio": false}}]}, "staff": {"edges": [{"role": "Original Creator", "node": {"id": 116915, "name": {"full": "Natsuki Kizu", "native": "キヅナツキ"}}}, {"role": "Director", "node": {"id": 146103, "name": {"full": "Noriko Hashimoto", "native": "橋本能理子"}}}, {"role": "Character Design", "node": {"id": 144381, "name": {"full": "Mina Oosawa", "native": "大沢美奈"}}}, {"role": "Art Director", "node": {"id": 174793, "name": {"full": "Hiroyuki Betsuyaku", "n